#MOVIELISTCREATEVIEW
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/movies/?search=Ramayana&genre=fantasy
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### ADD MOVIE
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/movies/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123

{
    "title": "Ramayana",
    "description": "Ancient Ramayana Story",
    "genre": "Fantasy",
    "duration": 169,
    "release_date": "2026-11-06"
}

#-------MovieRetrieveUpdateDeleteView------------------------------
### GET SINGLE MOVIE
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/movies/1/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### UPDATE MOVIE
###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/movies/3/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic ashwin:ashwin@123

{
    "id": 3,
    "title": "Ramayana",
    "description": "Ancient Ramayana Story",
    "genre": "Fantasy",
    "duration": 195,
    "release_date": "2026-11-06"
}


### DELETE MOVIE
###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/movies/4/
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### SHOW LIST------------------------------------------------------------------------------
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/shows/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### CREATE SHOW
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/shows/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123

{
    "movie": 1,
    "show_date": "2026-12-20",
    "show_time": "18:30:00",
    "theatre": "PVR Cinemas",
    "ticket_price": "150.00",
    "total_seats": 100
}

----#ShowRetrieveUpdateDelete----------------------------------------
### GET SINGLE SHOW
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/shows/3/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### UPDATE SHOW
###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/shows/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123

{
    "movie": 1,
    "show_date": "2026-12-21",
    "show_time": "20:00:00",
    "theatre": "PVR Cinemas",
    "ticket_price": "180.00",
    "total_seats": 100
}


### DELETE SHOW
###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/shows/1/
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### VIEW MY BOOKINGS-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/bookings/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### BOOK TICKETS
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/bookings/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123

{
    "show": 3,
    "number_of_seats": 3
}


### VIEW SINGLE BOOKING
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/bookings/1/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123


### CANCEL BOOKING
###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/bookings/1/
Authorization: Basic adi:adi@123
